WEBVTT

00:09:58.922 --> 00:10:00.670
So how do we take this idea

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.713
of the missing 33 percent

00:10:02.713 --> 00:10:04.884
and turn it into action?

00:10:04.884 --> 00:10:08.281
Well, for women, the answer is obvious:

00:10:08.281 --> 00:10:10.554
we have to begin to focus more

00:10:10.554 --> 00:10:12.491
on developing and demonstrating

00:10:12.491 --> 00:10:14.190
the skills we have

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.639
that show that we're people who understand

00:10:16.639 --> 00:10:18.912
our businesses, where they're headed,

00:10:18.912 --> 00:10:21.330
and our role in taking it there.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.726
That's what enables that breakthrough

00:10:23.726 --> 00:10:25.999
from middle management

00:10:25.999 --> 00:10:28.867
to leadership at the top.

00:10:28.867 --> 00:10:31.230
But you don't have to be a middle manager to do this.